        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mihayo ya ng'wa Solomoni kū banhū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Solomoni ūhaya, “Ū SEEBA ahayile gīkī akwikala ng'wilunde lya giiti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha nazengaga hekalu yawiza kūlwa nguno yako, ipandī lyako lya kwikala welelo bose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū ntemi ūlīgalūkīla ī libità lya Baisilaeli, aho bataalī bīmīīlile pye a Baisilaeli abo baalī bibilinga henaho, ūbalombela mbango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya, “Akumīlījiwe ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Baisilaeli; ūyo washikīlīgije na nkono gwakwe īyo wīhaya na nomo gwakwe wei ng'wenekīlī, ūng'wisagīja ū baba Daūdi alīhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Kūfuma lūshikū lwene aho nakabīnja mu sī ya Misili a banhū bane, nataalī kūsola nzengo mu lūganda lose lose lwa Baisilaeli gīkī īzengwe moi hekalu kūlwa nguno ya lina lyane nabize henaho; nūūlū nataalī kūnsola ose ose abize nsugi wabo a banhū bane a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī haha nagūsolile ū nzengo gwa Yelusalemu, gīkī ī lina lyane lībize ng'wenūmo, hama nansolile Daūdi kūbasuga a banhū bane a Baisilaeli.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū baba ū Daūdi walī nago ū mhayo gwenūyū ū mu ng'holò yakwe; ū gwa kūzenga hekalu kūlwa nguno ya lina lya ng'wa SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA akang'wīla ū baba ū Daūdi gīkī, ‘Īkī ū mu ng'holò yako ūlī na mhayo gwa kūzenga hekalu kūlwa nguno ya lina lyane, ūtūngīlīgije; īlī chiza īkī ūlī na mhayo gūlī gīko ū mu ng'holò yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū bebe ūtīzenga ī hekalu; ūyo akūzenga hekalu kūlwa lina lyane akūbiza ng'witūnja wako, ūyo alī mīlī gwako na mininga gako gete.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī haha, ū SEEBA wagūshikīlījaga ū kwisagīja kwakwe gīt'ūmo gūlī; nguno ū nene ningīlile a ha būtemi bo ng'wa baba, hanuma ī haha ūūyū naligasīgije nī lisumbī lya būtemi wa Isilaeli gīt'ūmo wahayīla ū SEEBA. Nī hekalu nīzengile kūlwa nguno ya lina lyakwe ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilael; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nī lisandīko nalītūūlaga mo, īlo mu gatī yalyo būlīmo būlagane bo ng'wa SEEBA, ūbo akabeeja na Baisilaeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlomba kwa ng'wa Solomoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū Solomoni wīmīīla ū kū būtongi bo ng'walīlo go ng'wa SEEBA, pyī ī libità lya Baisilaeli līng'wiloleelile; hūna ūgagoloola a makono gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī wabeeja lūtala lwa shaba ūlūtūūla ha gatī gatī ya gwaalugwa, lwalī lwa būlīhu wa fuuti mpungatī na nusu, nū būgalī galī gīko, ū būgūngūhu fuuti inè na nusu. Na lūūlū wīmīīla a ha lūtala lwenūlo, hūna ūtuja mazwi kū būtongi wa Baisilaeli bose; hanuma ūgagoloola a makono gakwe kūlola ng'wigūlū; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūhaya, “Ee SEEBA Mulungu wa Baisilaeli, atīho Mulungu ūngī wa kūbiza gītī bebe; ībize kwigūlya ng'wigūlū, nūūlū hasī ū mu sī. Atīho wa kūbiza gītī bebe ūyo ūkadimīīlaga mu butogwa būlagane ūbo walagana na batūmami bako, abo shikū jose bakashimīzīlaga mu nzīla jako na ng'holò īmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wīshikīlīgije īyo wang'wisagīja ū ntūmami wako ū baba ū Daūdi. Nguno walī wang'wisagīja na nomo gwako bebe ng'wenekīlī, hama ī haha washikīlījaga na nkono gwako gete, gīt'ūmo īlī lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū SEEBA Mulungu wa Isilaeli, ū ntūmami wako ū baba ū Daūdi nshikīlīgījage ū mhayo ūyo wang'wisagīja; aho ūkahaya gīkī, ‘A bitūnja bako ūlū bilang'hana ū mu shītīle shabo shose, būdūla kūshimīza kū būtongi wane gīt'ūmo ūkūshimīzīlaga bebe, ūtūgayiwa munhū wa kwigasha kū būtongi wane a hisumbī lya būtemi wa Isilaeli.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee SEEBA Mulungu wa Isilaeli, nalīkūlomba ūnshikīlīgīje ū ntūmami wako ū baba ū Daūdi, ū mhayo gwako ūyo wang'wisagīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo, ū Mulungu adūgije kwikala mu sī hamò na banhū gete? Nguno ī ligūlū lītakwigelile, pyī nūūlū ī ligūlū īlo līlī kwigūlya no no no lītīko ū kūkwigela; sumbagwa na hekalu īyī nīzengile nene īyī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike nahene degelekaga ū kūlomba kwa ntūmami wako, nū kūlīla kwakwe kūlwa kūkooba shigongo kūfuma kūlī bebe SEEBA Mulungu wane. Igwaga ū kūlīla kwa ntūmami wako nū kūlomba kwakwe ūyo alīkūlomba kū būtongi wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A miso gako galole, gībone būlī lūshikū ī hekalu yenīyī līīmi na būjikū, ī lipandī īlo bebe ng'wenekīlī ūkahaya gīkī ūkūlītūūla henaho ī lina lyako. Igwaga ū kūlomba kwa ntūmami wako būl'ikanza aho akūkūlombaga alolelile ū kū ipandī lyenīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntūmami wako na a banhū bako ūlū būkūlomba balolelile ū kū ipandī lyenīlī, igwagwa ū kūlomba kwabo. Igwaga kūfuma ū kū wikalo wako ū ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū wilemeelwa na ng'wiye hūna yūng'wigeleelwa kwilahīla, wiza mu hekalu īyī kwilahīla kū būtongi bo ng'walīlo gwako; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "igwaga kūfuma ū ng'wigūlū, wīte mhayo. Balamulage a batūmami bako, ū ng'hūbi ūng'winhe nsango, ū būbi wakwe ūngwisīje ha ntwe gwakwe wei ng'wenekīkī. Alīyo ū ntūngīlīja ūng'oleche hape gīkī atī na kabi, ūng'wītīle ya kwigeleelwa ūmo wiza bokwe būlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū bako a Baisilaeli ūlū būpyenwa na banishi babo nguno ya kūkūhūba, alīyo hanuma būkūgalūkīla būlīlīlīīla lina lyako, kūnū bakūlombaga na kūkūlīlīīla kūfuma ū mu hekalu īyī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "igwaga kūfuma ū ng'wigūlū, ūbalekeje a banhū bako a Baisilaeli, ūbashoshe hangī ū mu sī yabo īyo wabinha bakūlūgenji babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ligūlū ūlū lyūlugalwa yooya kūtūla ī mbula nguno a banhū bako baakūhūbile, alīyo ūlū būkūlomba balolelile ū kwipandī īlī na kūlīlīlīīla ī lina lyako, būgalūka bīnga ū mu hūbūbi wabo nguno baabonile gīkī baaluhile no, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bigwage kūfuma ū ng'wigūlū, ūbalekeje ū būkenaagūji wabo a batūmami bako a Baisilaeli. Balangage ī nzīla ya kikalīle kawiza, nī mbula ūbatūmīle ū mu sī yabo īyo wabinha a banhū bako kūbiza ya wingīji wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī ūlū yūgwīlwa nzala, nūūlū ihūūya, nūūlū lūguukule, nūūlū booba, nūūlū jilonga njige, nūūlū mbilīzī ng'henaagūji; nūūlū būdumīlwa na banishi mu nzengo gwabo gūmò gwaho, nūūlū būgwīlwa iyanga lya mbika yose yose nūūlū būsangwa mabūsaatu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alīyo ūlū wītwa būlombi nūūlū kwikūmbīlīja kose kose na munhū ose ose ū mu banhū bako a Baisilaeli, gīt'ūmo būlī ng'wene amanile būluhi ūbo būlī mu ng'holò yakwe, hūna ūkwambīla makono alolelile ū kū hekalu yenīyī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "igwaga kūfuma ū kū wikalo wako ī ng'wigūlū. Lekejaga hama wīte mhayo, ūngabīle būlī munhū gīt'ūmo igeleelilwe; kūlenganīla nī shītīle shakwe, nguno ūmanile ī ng'holò yakwe (bebe iyene dūhū h'ūyo ūjimanile ī ng'holò ja banhū). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū mu gīko bakūkogoha na bakūshimīzīla mu nzīla jako ū ng'wikanza ī lyose īlo balī ū mu sī īyo wabinha bakūlūgenji bise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū munhū ngeni ūyo atī ūmò wa banhū bako a Baisilaeli, ūlū wiza kūfuma sī ya kūle kūlwa nguno ya lina lyako itaale na būdūla wa nkono gwako ūyo gūgoloolilwe; ū munhū gītī ng'wenūyo ūlū wiza kūkūlomba alolelile kū hekalu yenīyī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "igwaga kūfuma ū kū wikalo wako ū ng'wigūlū, ūng'wītīle ū ngeni ng'wenūyo gīt'ūmo kūlī kūlomba kwakwe, ū mu gīko a banhū ba mu sī hose pye bakūlīmana ī lina lyako, na bakūkogoha gīt'ūmo balī a banhū bako a Baisilaeli; nīyo bakūmana hape gīkī ng'hana ī numba īyo nīzengile yenīyī īkwitanīlagwa kū lina lyako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī a banhū bako ūlū būja kū būlūgū kwilwisha na banishi babo hose hose ūko ūlabatūme, ūlū būnomba ū SEEBA balolelile ū kū nzengo ūyo wagūsola bebe gwenūyū nū kū hekalu īyo nīzengile kūlwa nguno ya lina lyako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "igwaga kūfuma ū ng'wigūlū ū kūlomba kwabo nū kūlīla kwabo, ūbīītīle gīt'ūmo kūlomba kwabo kūlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū būkūhūba mhayo gose gose ū bebe; īkī atīho munhū ūyo atahūbaga, hūna ūbapelanīla ūbatūūla mu makono ga ng'wanishi, ūbadima na kūbatwala nding'wa kū sī yakwe kūle nūūlū bbihī; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alīyo aho balī ū mu sī ya būding'wa wabo yenīyo bashikile kūgalūka, ī ng'holò jabo jūkūshokela būkūlīlīīla ū mu sī ya banhū abo babapyena benabo, būlīla balīhaya, ‘Tūlī bahūbi, twīta yabūbi na yamalofu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū būkūgalūkīla na ng'holò jabo jose na būpanga wabo bose aho balī ū mu sī ya banishi babo abo babadima nding'wa, hūna būkūlomba balolelile ū kū sī īyo wabinha bakūlūgenji babo, nū kū nzengo ūyo bebe ng'wenekīlī wagūsola, nī hekalu īyo nīzengile kūlwa lina lyako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "igwaga kūfuma ū kū wikalo wako ī ng'wigūlū; ūkwigwe ū kūlomba kwabo nū kūlīla kwabo, ūbīītīle ūmo kūlomba kwabo kūlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balekejage a banhū bako abo baakūhūbaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū Ee SEEBA Mulungu, ī haha būkaga; wize ū kwipandī lyako lya kwifuula, ū bebe nī lisandīko lya būdūla wako. Ee SEEBA Mulungu, leka a bagabīji bako bazwīkwe būpīji; a beela bako bayegele mu wiza wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee SEEBA Mulungu, ūtizūmponya ū ng'witīīlwa maguta wako. Shiizūkagwe ī shigongo shako, gīt'ūmo walī wang'wisagīja ū ntūmami wako ū Daūdi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
